{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o046b","title":"钟会征蜀至汉川祭诸葛亮庙禁军刍牧樵采","accounts":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o046b-account","label":"《诸葛亮传第五》正文","text":"钟会征蜀至汉川祭诸葛亮庙禁军刍牧樵采","evidence":["zhuge-e-o046b-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-6-e3","label":"正文","text":"钟会西出阳安口祭诸葛亮墓","evidence":["wgc-q0457","wgc-q0072"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0073","role":"祭庙禁令","evidence":["zhuge-e-o046b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":263,"label":"秋","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhuge-y263","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhuge-q-o086","basis":"秋"},"evidence":["zhuge-e-o046b-q","zhuge-q-o086","zhuge-q-b-3a665f982f59f4321b04"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-o046b-q","source_order":[35,266,"O046b"],"order":6807}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0073","name":"钟会","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0072","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-78045a2622266a435eeb","layer":"original","quote":"蜀监军王含守乐城，护军蒋斌守汉城，兵各五千。会使护军荀恺、前将军李辅各统万人：恺围汉城，辅围乐城。会径过，西出阳安口〖7〗，遣人祭诸葛亮之墓〖8〗。使护军胡烈等行前，攻破关城〖9〗，得库藏积谷。姜维自沓中还，至阴平，合集士众，欲赴关城。未到，闻其已破，退趋白水，与蜀将张翼、廖化等合守剑阁拒会〖10〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":473,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0457","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-78045a2622266a435eeb","layer":"original","quote":"会径过，西出阳安口〖7〗，遣人祭诸葛亮之墓","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":473,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":49,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o046b-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e27e5f8f7352789295d2","layer":"original","quote":"秋，魏镇西将军钟会征蜀，至汉川；祭亮之庙，令军士不得于亮墓所左右刍牧樵采〖34〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":265,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-3a665f982f59f4321b04","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-3a665f982f59f4321b04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖18〗六年：景耀六年（公元 263）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":429,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5c4c42970dd122437e5b","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o086","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-9fe4ebfa42a59d8d7bb9","layer":"original","quote":"六年冬〖18〗，魏征西将军邓艾伐蜀，自阴平由景谷道旁入〖19〗。瞻督诸军至涪停住；前锋破，退还，住绵竹。艾遣书诱瞻曰：“若降者，必表为琅邪王〖20〗。”瞻怒，斩艾使。遂战，大败；临阵死，时年三十七。众皆离散，艾长驱至成都。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":409,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
